<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>彭博社 实时热点</title><link>https://feeds.bloomberg.com/markets/news.rss</link><description>彭博社 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 05:47:32 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>习近平调查上海领导人，扩大政治变动</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/xi-probes-shanghai-boss-widening-political-shakeup-video</link><description>中国已对中央政治局委员、上海市委书记陈吉宁涉嫌严重违纪违法立案调查。彭博经济研究公司的尼尔·托马斯 (Neil Thomas) 有这样的背景。 （来源：彭博社）&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/xi-probes-shanghai-boss-widening-political-shakeup-video'&gt;习近平调查上海领导人，扩大政治变动&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Xi Probes Shanghai Boss, Widening Political Shakeup&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/xi-probes-shanghai-boss-widening-political-shakeup-video</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 04:25:11 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>随着人工智能贸易衰退、石油价格下跌，股票损失加剧：市场结束</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/asian-stocks-to-slide-as-ai-trade-doubts-resurface-markets-wrap</link><description>由于对人工智能繁荣持久性的怀疑导致科技股撤退，股票遭到抛售，期货进一步走软。国债因避险需求而上涨。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/asian-stocks-to-slide-as-ai-trade-doubts-resurface-markets-wrap'&gt;随着人工智能贸易衰退、石油价格下跌，股票损失加剧：市场结束&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Stock Losses Build as AI Trade Falters, Oil Drops: Markets Wrap&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/asian-stocks-to-slide-as-ai-trade-doubts-resurface-markets-wrap</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 22:09:18 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>随着人工智能抛售的恢复，印度股市延续了世界领先的涨势</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/indian-stocks-extend-world-beating-run-as-ai-selloff-resumes</link><description>印度股市飙升，延续了 11 月份全球领先的涨势，因为全球人工智能公司的新一轮抛售推动了对该主题敞口有限的市场的轮动。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/indian-stocks-extend-world-beating-run-as-ai-selloff-resumes'&gt;随着人工智能抛售的恢复，印度股市延续了世界领先的涨势&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Indian Stocks Extend World-Beating Run as AI Selloff Resumes&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/indian-stocks-extend-world-beating-run-as-ai-selloff-resumes</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 05:04:20 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>随着芯片限制冲击数据中心，马来亚银行审查投资组合</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/maybank-reviews-portfolio-as-chip-curbs-hit-data-center-projects</link><description>马来西亚最大的银行正在审查其投资组合，以了解美国最新芯片限制措施的潜在风险，同时评估这些限制可能如何影响数据中心客户及其融资需求。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/maybank-reviews-portfolio-as-chip-curbs-hit-data-center-projects'&gt;随着芯片限制冲击数据中心，马来亚银行审查投资组合&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Maybank Reviews Portfolio as Chip Curbs Hit Data Centers&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/maybank-reviews-portfolio-as-chip-curbs-hit-data-center-projects</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 04:35:30 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>11 月 25 日最新石油市场新闻和分析</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/latest-oil-market-news-and-analysis-for-nov-25</link><description>由于原油供应增加的迹象超过了霍尔木兹海峡周围船只遭受的袭击升级，油价下跌。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/latest-oil-market-news-and-analysis-for-nov-25'&gt;11 月 25 日最新石油市场新闻和分析&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Latest Oil Market News and Analysis for Nov. 25&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/latest-oil-market-news-and-analysis-for-nov-25</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 23:06:29 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>Kochugovindan：科技波动将持续存在</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/kochugovindan-tech-volatility-is-here-to-stay-video</link><description>Aberdeen Investments 高级研究经济学家 Sree Kochugovindan 表示，随着投资者仔细审视估值、盈利潜力和投资回报，人工智能行业面临进一步的下行风险。她还在彭博社的“中东和非洲地平线”节目中与阿比尔·阿布·奥马尔讨论了美国消费者支出、通胀和美联储政策的前景。 （来源：彭博社）&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/kochugovindan-tech-volatility-is-here-to-stay-video'&gt;Kochugovindan：科技波动将持续存在&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Kochugovindan: Tech Volatility Is Here to Stay&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/kochugovindan-tech-volatility-is-here-to-stay-video</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 05:37:11 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>安瓦尔助手称马来西亚政府可能会任期满</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/malaysia-s-government-will-likely-serve-full-term-anwar-adviser</link><description>马来西亚总理安瓦尔·易卜拉欣的高级政治顾问扎夫鲁·阿齐兹表示，尽管最近有关于提前选举的猜测，但他的政府可能会任期到任期结束。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/malaysia-s-government-will-likely-serve-full-term-anwar-adviser'&gt;安瓦尔助手称马来西亚政府可能会任期满&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Malaysia Government Likely to Serve Full Term, Anwar Aide Says&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/malaysia-s-government-will-likely-serve-full-term-anwar-adviser</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 05:03:48 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>人工智能怀疑和加息押注扰乱股市，金价持续下跌</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/gold-holds-decline-as-us-tariff-plans-reinforce-rate-hike-bets</link><description>黄金价格持续下跌，因人们对人工智能热潮能否持久的怀疑而导致股市下跌，而白宫最新的关税计划强化了对美联储加息的预期。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/gold-holds-decline-as-us-tariff-plans-reinforce-rate-hike-bets'&gt;人工智能怀疑和加息押注扰乱股市，金价持续下跌&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Gold Holds Decline as AI Doubts and Rate-Hike Bets Rattle Stocks&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/gold-holds-decline-as-us-tariff-plans-reinforce-rate-hike-bets</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 23:51:22 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>